Name:Chef
Desc:In the first night, the Chef wakes and is assigned a waiter on each team, by the Host pointing at them, though the waiters are not aware of this. The Chef dies if all their waiters are dead. If both the Chef and at least on waiter remain when the game ends, the Chef wins. The Chef wakes up every night and sends a healing meal to another player. That player is protected for the rest of the night but can not receive food again. In bigger games, the Host may need to note waiters and who has received food.
Card:Every night, the Chef chooses a player to protect, but can not protect the same player twice. The Chef has an waiter, who are unaware of this, on each team. The Chef dies if their last waiter dies.
